        "remove_horizontal_spacing": true,
        "liquid": "<style>\n.wl-faq{background:#ffffff;padding:56px 20px 64px}\n.wl-faq-inner{max-width:700px;margin:0 auto}\n.wl-tag{font-size:11px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#2d8a47;margin-bottom:8px;display:block;font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif}\n.wl-h2{font-size:clamp(24px,4.8vw,40px);font-weight:900;line-height:1.12;margin:0 0 28px;color:#1a1a1a;font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif}\n.wl-h2 em{color:#2d8a47;font-style:normal}\n\n.wl-faq-item{border-bottom:1.5px solid #e8e4dc;transition:background .2s}\n.wl-faq-item:first-of-type{border-top:1.5px solid #e8e4dc}\n.wl-faq-q{font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#1a1a1a;padding:18px 0;cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px;font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif;list-style:none;justify-content:space-between}\n.wl-faq-emoji{font-size:20px;flex-shrink:0;line-height:1.2;margin-top:-1px}\n.wl-faq-q-text{flex:1;line-height:1.35}\n.wl-faq-chevron{font-size:13px;color:#6b7280;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:4px;transition:transform .25s}\n.wl-faq-item.open .wl-faq-chevron{transform:rotate(180deg);color:#1e5631}\n.wl-faq-a{font-size:14.5px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;padding:0 0 20px 34px;display:none;font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif}\n.wl-faq-item.open .wl-faq-a{display:block}\n.wl-faq-a strong{color:#1a1a1a;font-weight:900}\n\n.wl-faq-end{margin-top:32px;padding:20px 22px;background:#fff9ed;border:1.5px solid #f5d78a;border-radius:14px;text-align:center;font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif}\n.wl-faq-end-t{font-size:14px;font-weight:900;color:#1a1a1a;margin-bottom:6px}\n.wl-faq-end-s{font-size:13px;color:#6b7280;margin-bottom:12px;line-height:1.5}\n.wl-faq-end-a{display:inline-block;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#1e5631;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-thickness:2px;text-underline-offset:3px}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"wl-faq\">\n  <div class=\"wl-faq-inner\">\n\n    <span class=\"wl-tag\">Questions honnêtes</span>\n    <h2 class=\"wl-h2\">Ce que vous vous demandez<br><em>avant d'acheter.</em></h2>\n\n    <!-- Q1 : Âge -->\n    <div class=\"wl-faq-item\">\n      <div class=\"wl-faq-q\" onclick=\"this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')\">\n        <span class=\"wl-faq-emoji\">👶</span>\n        <span class=\"wl-faq-q-text\">À partir de quel âge ?</span>\n        <span class=\"wl-faq-chevron\">▼</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"wl-faq-a\">\n        <p>Dès <strong>6 ans</strong> en autonomie totale. Les missions sont graduées jusqu'à 14 ans.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Q2 : Solidité -->\n    <div class=\"wl-faq-item\">\n      <div class=\"wl-faq-q\" onclick=\"this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')\">\n        <span class=\"wl-faq-emoji\">💪</span>\n        <span class=\"wl-faq-q-text\">C'est solide ?</span>\n        <span class=\"wl-faq-chevron\">▼</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"wl-faq-a\">\n        <p>Oui. Châssis <strong>ABS renforcé</strong>, testé chute 1 mètre. Conçu pour résister aux mains d'enfant.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Q3 : Utilisation -->\n    <div class=\"wl-faq-item\">\n      <div class=\"wl-faq-q\" onclick=\"this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')\">\n        <span class=\"wl-faq-emoji\">🔬</span>\n        <span class=\"wl-faq-q-text\">C'est facile à utiliser ?</span>\n        <span class=\"wl-faq-chevron\">▼</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"wl-faq-a\">\n        <p>Deux molettes simples, un bouton photo. <strong>Maîtrisé en 5 minutes</strong>, sans l'aide d'un parent.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Q4 : Écran -->\n    <div class=\"wl-faq-item\">\n      <div class=\"wl-faq-q\" onclick=\"this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')\">\n        <span class=\"wl-faq-emoji\">📱</span>\n        <span class=\"wl-faq-q-text\">Encore un écran ?</span>\n        <span class=\"wl-faq-chevron\">▼</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"wl-faq-a\">\n        <p>Non, c'est <strong>l'inverse d'une tablette</strong>. L'écran ne s'allume que dehors, quand l'enfant a trouvé quelque chose à observer.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Q5 : Missions -->\n    <div class=\"wl-faq-item\">\n      <div class=\"wl-faq-q\" onclick=\"this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')\">\n        <span class=\"wl-faq-emoji\">📋</span>\n        <span class=\"wl-faq-q-text\">Comment je reçois les 100 missions ?</span>\n        <span class=\"wl-faq-chevron\">▼</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"wl-faq-a\">\n        <p>Un <strong>QR code dans la boîte</strong>. Il donne accès au PDF, téléchargeable sur mobile ou imprimable.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Q6 : Livraison -->\n    <div class=\"wl-faq-item\">\n      <div class=\"wl-faq-q\" onclick=\"this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')\">\n        <span class=\"wl-faq-emoji\">🚚</span>\n        <span class=\"wl-faq-q-text\">Livraison en combien de temps ?</span>\n        <span class=\"wl-faq-chevron\">▼</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"wl-faq-a\">\n        <p>Expédition sous 24h. <strong>Livraison 3 à 7 jours ouvrés</strong>. Suivi envoyé par email.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Q7 : Garantie -->\n    <div class=\"wl-faq-item\">\n      <div class=\"wl-faq-q\" onclick=\"this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')\">\n        <span class=\"wl-faq-emoji\">🛡️</span>\n        <span class=\"wl-faq-q-text\">Et si mon enfant n'aime pas ?</span>\n        <span class=\"wl-faq-chevron\">▼</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"wl-faq-a\">\n        <p><strong>30 jours satisfait ou remboursé</strong>, sans question. Vous renvoyez, on rembourse intégralement.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Bottom reassurance -->\n    <div class=\"wl-faq-end\">\n      <div class=\"wl-faq-end-t\">Une autre question ?</div>\n      <div class=\"wl-faq-end-s\">Écrivez-nous, on répond personnellement. Un vrai parent derrière chaque message.</div>\n      <a href=\"mailto:contact@wildscooper.fr\" class=\"wl-faq-end-a\">contact@wildscooper.fr →</a>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>",
